the event detail is going to be a scrollable screen , because when entering an event the user must see first the cover of the event , its name, the tags, and the participants and the members (envited people that can vote) when clicking on the participents a pop up must appear that shows also the names not just the profile picture, then the user scroll down to the rest of screen


if someone wants to vote but not invited to the event, he can click on the "request to vote" button and a pop up will appear that will ask him to write a message to the owner of the event, then the owner will receive a notification and he can accept or decline the request, if he accepts the user will be added to the list of invited users and he will be able to vote, if he declines the user will receive a notification that his request was declined.